OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 19 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Dvorak
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,6,     Gand loves of Antonin Dvorak.
OL,7,     GToday, one of the guiding forces
OL,8,     Gin everything he did and created
OL,9,     G- his nearest and dearest.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by bass-
OL,12,     Gbaritone Gerald Finley ahead of
OL,13,     Ghis performance with the LSO, and
OL,14,     Gpianist Samson Tsoy performs live
OL,15,     Gin the studio.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
